type: software
title: "Human Action Classification: Pose-based and Video-based Models"
abstract: "Modern human action classification system supporting both pose-based (MediaPipe) and video-based (3D CNN) approaches. Includes 100+ model architectures achieving real-time performance for pose classification and reference implementations for temporal action recognition on UCF-101 (87% accuracy) and HMDB51 (56% accuracy). Designed for autonomous vehicles, video surveillance, and action recognition research."
